    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What happened to Kamilia?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654030/extras/90be2e3866c6089662fcc7a7380765a8.avif?t=1749475591\" width=600 height=224 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kamilia is a unique detective mystery, that follows the story of a talented painter, as he finds himself involved in an ongoing murder investigation that was left unsolved for years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654030/extras/cfdaface93dfd9f0f728a8b22b50909f.avif?t=1749475591\" width=600 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 1909, a dramatic event shook the entire town of Roga and started a chain of events that led to an unsolvable crime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 years later, it is up to you to learn the truth, and clear the unsettling shadows of death that took over Roga.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654030/extras/9e9349a2caae555026074fb7ac5a504b.avif?t=1749475591\" width=600 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the game, you will play as multiple characters, and make important choices that will shape the outcome of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654030/extras/cbc949e8d733c59becfce922889b3148.avif?t=1749475591\" width=600 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an intense and emotional story, as the painter struggles to unveil the town's secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654030/extras/d6888676dcaedb50726e454210521482.avif?t=1749475591\" width=600 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Unique story-rich visual novel, with moderate puzzle elements.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings, based on the choices you make.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interesting and complex characters for you to meet.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovely pixel art style.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cherry-picked soundtrack, including an original song - 'Lilies'</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What happened to Kamilia?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654030/extras/90be2e3866c6089662fcc7a7380765a8.avif?t=1749475591\" width=600 height=224 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kamilia is a unique detective mystery, that follows the story of a talented painter, as he finds himself involved in an ongoing murder investigation that was left unsolved for years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654030/extras/cfdaface93dfd9f0f728a8b22b50909f.avif?t=1749475591\" width=600 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 1909, a dramatic event shook the entire town of Roga and started a chain of events that led to an unsolvable crime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 years later, it is up to you to learn the truth, and clear the unsettling shadows of death that took over Roga.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654030/extras/9e9349a2caae555026074fb7ac5a504b.avif?t=1749475591\" width=600 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the game, you will play as multiple characters, and make important choices that will shape the outcome of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654030/extras/cbc949e8d733c59becfce922889b3148.avif?t=1749475591\" width=600 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an intense and emotional story, as the painter struggles to unveil the town's secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654030/extras/d6888676dcaedb50726e454210521482.avif?t=1749475591\" width=600 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Unique story-rich visual novel, with moderate puzzle elements.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings, based on the choices you make.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interesting and complex characters for you to meet.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovely pixel art style.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cherry-picked soundtrack, including an original song - 'Lilies'</p></li></ul>",
